<li><a href="https://terrestris.de/en/products/free-osm-wms/">terrestris OSM WMS</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.geoboundaries.org/">geoBoundaries</a></li>
<li><a href="https://gadm.org/">GADM</a></li>
<li><a href="https://nasa-gibs.github.io/gibs-api-docs/">NASA GIBS</a></li>
</ul>


</section>

